'' A 'const as ustring' FOR A 'byval as ustring' PARAMETER. ByvalStrTemp_'s ustring arm
'' asked the constant for an address, got none, and 'P( G )' was dropped: TKO0994. The
'' temporary is now initialised from the constant's text, as 'dim w as ustring = G' is
'' (src/mir/lowerstrargs.tiko) -- a procedure, a function, a constructor and a method.
'' fbc-modern 1.20 has no 'const as ustring' (error 24), so there is no differential.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 tests/driver/src/const-ustring-byval.bas -o tests/driver/constustrbyval.exe
'' ENV: TIKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-FILE: tests/driver/constustrbyval.exe
'' RUN: tests/driver/constustrbyval.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: hi 2
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: ns 2
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: hi!
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: hi|hi
'' EXPECT-RUN-EXIT: 0
